  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop capsicum.\n• Drain and rinse red kidney beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cb0f2c76eddc47d13e9b/step-6269ca00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook broccoli florets and capsicum until tender, 4-5 minutes. Add mild Caribbean jerk seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in kidney beans, coconut milk, stock concentrate and the water. Simmer until thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Remove from heat, then stir in baby spinach leaves until wilted. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• TIP: Add a splash more water if the curry looks too thick.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cb0f2c76eddc47d13e9b/step-82a36310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a microwave-safe bowl, microwave basmati rice until steaming, 2-3 minutes.\n• Stir in the butter until coated. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cb0f2c76eddc47d13e9b/step-f027f620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rapid rice and Caribbean kidney bean coconut curry between bowls.\n• Tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cb0f2c76eddc47d13e9b/step-14cea830.jpg"
    }
  ]
